  "scope": "Verifies source/reference/recording identities, every declared trial and initial seeded state, every sensor-based controller selection/action/phase, continuous timing and native state/current at routing. Standing-release cases additionally check recorded body contact before recovery. Independently reconstructs sampled IMU, encoders, COM, velocity, linkage constraints and final-window posture gates. Recorded contacts and continuous guards rely on the hashed runner; no full dynamics rerun or mechanical qualification. Failed and unsupported recoveries remain failures."
